    "title": "Missoula school district to drop Arabic at Sentinel due to low enrollment - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Bowen West ,\n4 hours ago MISSOULA, Mont. — Missoula County Public Schools will not offer Arabic at Sentinel High School in the 2026-27 school year because of insufficient enrollment, according to an email from the district and a teacher who has led the program for years. Brendan Work, the head Arabic teacher for MCPS,... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
